<title>NEW ZEALAND: Baycorp lifts first half result.</title>
<headline>Baycorp lifts first half result.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to Dec 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 4.0 vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   10.5 vs 7.9</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			   10.0 vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				17.7 vs 15.9</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			  6.0 vs 4.5</p>
<p>    Tax					2.0 vs 1.4</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)    38.3 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credits.</p>
<p>Pay date March 27</p>
<p>Note - Baycorp Holdings Ltd is a debt collection company.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
